OpenPage (https://github.com/buildingopen/openpage), MIT License, by buildingopen
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
TribeCode's website designer (app/ui/sitecfg.js, app/ui/sitedesigner.js, server/sitedesign.js) follows OpenPage's
model: one JSON site config as the source of truth (a name, a theme and blocks, each with an id, type, variant and
props), a block picker with layout variants, theme presets set through CSS custom properties, inline text editing,
drag to reorder, undo/redo, a live preview and a standalone HTML export. OpenPage is built with React, Zustand and
dnd-kit; TribeCode reimplements the approach in plain browser JavaScript with no dependencies. No OpenPage source code
is included. Unlike OpenPage's export, TribeCode's export loads nothing from a CDN.

