feat/site-v2 (the deeper port, docs/OPENPAGE-PORT.md): OpenPage's block types and variants, its ten theme presets'
colors (app/ui/sitecfg.js PRESETS night … forest), its site settings (SEO title and description, favicon, share image,
language), responsive previews, duplicate/hide and its keyboard shortcuts were reimplemented the same way: no code copied.

